{
  "note": "Cumulative mobile performance and pace review: checked shared movement, projectile and ability tuning at 75% speed; inverse lifetime guards and preserved weapon reach; unchanged steering, firing cadence, cooldowns and active-shot caps; contour, label, HUD and native-path rendering; and snapshot precision, validation and pending-send behavior. Reviewed affected combat, terrain and HUD/network articles, source references and generated ship facts. All 13 Wiki demonstrations and posters were regenerated; the ten changed posters were visually inspected. The retained integrated pass covers 11 desktop/mobile Wiki, touch-control and real-socket motion/reconnect/fixture cases. The new 30 focused regression cases pass, covering literal pace and turn values, shot reach/cooldown, authoritative and client EO lifetime/range, complete selected-snapshot validation and current comparison-report fields. Both TypeScript checks and focused lint pass; the previous combined full gate passed. This acceptance records the full cumulative gameplay/rendering/media review before the final full gate.",
